      "content": "hey, i'm working on this philosophy essay for my ethics class about individual liberty vs collective responsibility, specifically regarding tax policy. can you give me a breakdown of the main moral frameworks used by libertarians and social democrats? i need to make sure i'm presenting the most compelling arguments for each side so my professor doesn't say i'm being biased. thanks!",
